<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91323" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυγμαῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυγμή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυγμή</span>
			<i>long</i> or <i>tall</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρόθινα π. κολοσσῷ ἐφαρμόζων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					1.19.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of men,
				<i>dwarfish</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				892a12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pr. n.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πυγμαῖοι, οἱ</span>, the <u>Pygmies</u>, a fabulous race of
			dwarfs on the upper Nile, said to have been warred on and destroyed
			by cranes, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				597a6
			</span></i>, cf. Hdt.l.c.</div>
